# F5 Distributed Cloud API token, read by xcbot.py fetch.
#
# Copy this file to xc_api_token.txt and replace the last line with your token.
# (xcbot.py fetch creates xc_api_token.txt for you if it is missing.)
#
# Get a token in the XC console:
#   Administration >> Personal Management >> Credentials >> Add Credentials
#   Credential type: API Token
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored, so these notes can stay. xc_api_token.txt
# is gitignored; this .example file is the one that gets committed.
PASTE_YOUR_XC_API_TOKEN_HERE
